%% Stage: Target
%% Last reviewed: 2026-04-25
%% 终态行为：Pair 并发渲染（Phase 2+）；与 seq-new-project.mmd（Phase 1 串行版）对照阅读
%%{init: {'theme':'default'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI as cli.cmd_new
    participant Orch as orchestrator
    participant Loader as project.Loader<br/>(internal/project/loader.go)
    participant FRegis as feature.Registry
    participant Sched as feature.Scheduler<br/>(拓扑排序 Requires/Order)
    participant Comp as component.WebServer
    participant PB as PairBuilder
    participant Pool as renderer.Pool<br/>(errgroup + GOMAXPROCS)
    participant Eng as template.Engine
    participant FM as fs.FileManager<br/>(flock + atomic write)
    participant AST as ast.Injector
    participant Hook as security.HookExecutor<br/>(policy: confirm/restricted)
    participant PROJ as PROJECT 文件

    User->>CLI: linctl new myblog --module ... --framework gin
    CLI->>CLI: complete(ctx) + validate(ctx)
    CLI->>Orch: Plan(ctx) → *Plan

    Orch->>Loader: BuildFromOptions(opts)
    Loader->>Loader: applyDefaults + validator.v10
    Loader-->>Orch: *Project

    Orch->>FRegis: RegisterAll()
    Note over FRegis: 加载所有 builtin Feature

    Orch->>Sched: 计算执行顺序
    Note over Sched: 1. 收集所有 Feature 的 Requires()<br/>2. Kahn 拓扑排序<br/>3. 同层用 Order 做 tie-break<br/>4. 检测环 → 直接 fail（详见 §8.6.1）
    Sched-->>Orch: ordered []Feature

    Orch->>Comp: NewWebServer(componentSpec)
    Comp->>PB: New(project)
    Comp->>PB: Add(组件自带 Pairs)

    loop for each Feature (按拓扑顺序)
        Orch->>Comp: feature.Apply(ctx, c) (纯函数)
        Comp->>PB: AddMany(featurePairs)
        Orch->>Comp: feature.ResourceContributions(c)
        Note over Orch: 调度器聚合 Resource，注入 Project（不在 Apply 中改入参）
    end

    Comp-->>Orch: PairBuilder.Build() → []Pair

    Orch->>FM: AcquireLock(ctx, rootDir, --lock-timeout)
    Note over FM: 阻塞 + 30s 超时（详见 §6.13）

    Orch->>FM: 准备目标目录 (mkdir -p myblog)

    %% Phase 2+ 终态：Pair 并发渲染
    par Pair 1 渲染
        Orch->>Pool: submit Pair[0]
        Pool->>Eng: Render(tpl, data)
        Eng-->>Pool: content
    and Pair 2 渲染
        Orch->>Pool: submit Pair[1]
        Pool->>Eng: Render(tpl, data)
        Eng-->>Pool: content
    and Pair N 渲染
        Orch->>Pool: submit Pair[N]
        Pool->>Eng: Render(tpl, data)
        Eng-->>Pool: content
    end

    Note over Pool: 渲染成功的 content 收集到内存；任一失败 → 中止整个 Apply

    %% 串行写入（持 flock，保证原子性）
    loop for each rendered content (串行写入)
        Orch->>FM: AtomicWrite(pair.Dst, content)
    end

    Orch->>AST: 收集 Mutators 并 batch 执行
    Note over AST: 同一文件多 mutator 合并为单次 parse + 改 + write

    Orch->>Hook: 执行 PostApply hooks
    Note over Hook: policy=confirm 时逐条 prompt；CI 强制 restricted

    Orch->>PROJ: Save(project, status)
    Note over PROJ: 写出"工具维护"的 PROJECT 文件（含 generatedAt / cliVersion）

    Orch->>FM: Release()
    Orch-->>CLI: Apply(ctx, plan) → *Report
    CLI->>User: 彩色输出 + getting started 提示
